WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.880
<i>Will Nether Gundam</i>
<i>of Neo Holland</i>...

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.420
...<i>be able to recover now?</i>

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:59.340
I'm amazed you even made it
to the Final Battle.

00:02:00.110 --> 00:02:01.050
Take that back!

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:04.100
Weak Gundams like yours...

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.770
...must be punished!

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.480
Here we go, Hercules!

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.110
I'll show you!

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:17.860
Take this!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.740
Nether Typhoon!

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:22.450
I did it!

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:30.250
Take this!
Lightning of Judgment!

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.060
Now, everyone...

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.190
...that Gundam is the favorite
to win the championship.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.150
Zeus Gundam of Neo Greece.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:56.360
One powerfuI-looking Gundam,
wouldn't you say?

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:59.610
But during the
opening ceremonies...

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.070
...Domon said the following
to Master Asia...

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.610
Master...

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:06.030
...I'll win all of my matches
just so I can fight you!

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:09.620
That would seem
easier said than done.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:12.670
Especially since Domon is
still unfamiliar...

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:14.500
...with the God Gundam's
ultimate weapon.

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.960
And now...

00:03:16.960 --> 00:03:21.470
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:27.510
A New Weapon!
Erupting God Finger!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.780
That particular round
was very dull.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.530
Now, for his next opponent...

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.880
...God Gundam, saying he'd
win all of his matches.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.670
I like that. Let's go with that.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.270
Should Domon Kasshu lose...

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.370
...it just proves he doesn't have
what it takes.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.520
Never mind the championship.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:18.020
Exactly!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.690
Oh, my.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.530
Are you worried about
who Domon will fight next?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:28.780
A lion throws his cubs
down a mountain...

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:31.450
...and recognizes only those
who climb back up as his own.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.250
We'll use that example...

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.580
...and have Domon fight
only against the best.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.840
And when he wins
against the best...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.010
...he will finally be a Fighter
worthy of my recognition.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:42.840
I agree...

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.630
...for my sake as well.

00:04:44.630 --> 00:04:46.010
Let's hope so, Master.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.810
Wait, Domon!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:57.310
Please, just wait!

00:04:58.770 --> 00:04:59.980
Hey, Domon!

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:02.660
There's no need
to walk off like that!

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.360
I chose this place
so you could relax...

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.070
...and focus only on your matches.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.580
But it just doesn't suit me, okay?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.040
Why not?

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.250
Well, I'll see you at
the stadium tomorrow.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.000
Wait!

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.960
Oh, Domon Kasshu!
The man I wanted to see!

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.510
We were just...

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.630
If it's important, talk to Rain.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:28.680
Hey!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:31.470
We just got word on who
your first opponent will be.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:33.970
Oh?

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.480
You'll never believe it.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.190
You're facing Neo Greece.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:41.690
It can't be.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.980
Zeus Gundam.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.820
That's right.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.990
Everyone believes he will
win this year's championship.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:52.580
What are the odds of facing
the strongest in the first round?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.980
What's the big deal?!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.580
What are you guys so afraid of?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.960
We have God Gundam
in order to beat the likes of him.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.750
You seem confident!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:04.380
I didn't go to the Guyana Highlands
to train for nothing.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.170
Where are you going?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.420
To find a place to stay.

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:09.930
Wh-what?!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.630
He's off to look for a place to stay?

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:17.140
What's the big idea?!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.890
I suggest we let him do
as he pleases.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:20.980
Excuse me!

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:23.650
I really should bring him back!

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:24.230
Right.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.400
Rain...

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:30.910
That Domon!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.570
Domon...

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.350
It's the Fighter from Neo Japan.

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:53.470
I hear he's one of the favorites.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.060
- He's so cool!
- He's totally my type!

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.430
I hear his first opponent is...

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.060
...Zeus Gundam.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:01.730
Wong's put together
one tough match.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:02.980
This'll be a good match, though.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.400
Zeus is the most powerful...

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:08.780
...so I'd say seven-to-three-
No, nine-to-one for Zeus.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.490
I feel sorry for Domon Kasshu...

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.610
...about to lose the first round
after bragging that he'd sweep it.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.850
No one has any idea how
powerful my God Gundam is.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:27.670
That's...

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.130
...Zeus Gundam.

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:39.810
Impressive.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:42.670
I can understand why he's favored
to win the championship.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.770
But it's nothing compared to
my God Gundam.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.280
Oh? That's quite the bravado.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.780
You must be Domon Kasshu.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.790
Yeah, that's right.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.710
I'm Marcelot of Neo Greece.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.710
Accept that punch as a challenge
to your childish arrogance.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.800
H-he's huge!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.090
You see...

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:13.760
...a big-headed kid like yourself
makes me sick to my stomach.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.390
Then here's my greeting to you!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.020
How's that?

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.230
Why, you!

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.320
I can beat you!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.660
There's always someone
stronger than you.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:51.960
Perhaps you should've said
you'd lose all of your matches.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:10.690
I can't find him.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.400
I've looked all over the place.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.990
Well, we've got preparations
for tomorrow.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.740
I suggest you return to the hotel.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:17.320
Right.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.730
After I check the harbor
once more.

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:20.410
Bye.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.040
There's no doubt...

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.870
...Domon's erratic behavior
is becoming problematic.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:28.620
Absolutely!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:32.090
When will he wake up
to the fact that...

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.840
...he represents an entire nation?

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.260
Commissioner Karato.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.550
Let us have faith in him.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.050
You keep spoiling him.

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:41.720
Besides...

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.350
...he still doesn't even know...

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.020
...about God Gundam's
ultimate weapon yet.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:47.100
Yes.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.230
He doesn't know about the
Erupting God Finger.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.150
Domon, you fool.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.360
Where did you go?

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:15.000
What?!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:19.550
I'll teach weaklings like you...

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:22.680
...with the judgment
of the ultimate Gundam!

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.340
W-Was that a dream?

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:38.240
But if I fought now...

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.730
...I'd end up like that.

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:04.850
This is...

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:06.890
I see you're awake now.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:07.810
Who are you?!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.730
Who am I?
That's quite the morning greeting.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.270
That's right! He's right!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.940
We saved your life, you know!

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:30.040
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.420
Not to your liking?

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.760
I haven't thanked you yet
for saving me.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.220
Well, I couldn't just leave you
in the water.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.010
Thank you.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.140
Actually, I'm...

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.560
Domon Kasshu.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.180
We know you.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.440
You're the Gundam Fighter
from Neo Japan, right?

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:55.270
Your first match is today, right?

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:57.520
Yeah.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:58.520
What's the matter?

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.030
You look a little unfocused
for a Fighter.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.320
- Ming.
- Huh?

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.740
Could you pass me the
wander bug powder?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.700
"Wander bug"?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.460
Yes.

00:12:07.460 --> 00:12:09.240
It's right in front of you.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.410
This?

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:10.950
But, this is...

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:12.960
Yes. Yes. That's right.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.880
The wander bug...

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:17.950
...is only two centimeters long.

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:20.920
But it's a courageous
little fellow that...

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:23.630
...preys on insects several times
its size, and it usually wins.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.900
Although it's small and weak,
it never gives up...

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:28.010
...in order to survive.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:28.760
Here.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.100
Have some.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.440
An enemy several times my size...

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:42.740
<i>Every four years</i>...

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.610
...<i>the Gundam Fight decides</i>
<i>which nation rules Earth and space</i>.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.370
<i>Here at the No. 1 marine ring</i>...

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:52.080
...<i>the Gundams of our next match</i>
<i>are standing face to face</i>.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.080
<i>However</i>...

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.790
...<i>you can sense tension</i>
<i>with the Neo Japan team!</i>

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.540
<i>And it's no wonder</i>.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:12:59.750
<i>Their Fighter, Domon Kasshu</i>...

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.710
...<i>hasn't shown up yet!</i>

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.720
I certainly didn't expect this.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:13.390
I suppose he's afraid to
fight Zeus Gundam.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.440
Mr. Wong.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.150
You have no idea what
kind of man Domon Kasshu is.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.110
What do you mean?

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.190
Yes.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:24.070
The stronger his opponent,
the more he'll want to fight.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:28.140
That's the kind of martial artist
Domon Kasshu is.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.240
Think you've already lost to him?

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:33.750
Yeah.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.000
Do you really believe that?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:36.790
Yeah.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.250
So, you've realized
how weak you are...

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.500
...and have become afraid to fight.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.760
How delightful.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:44.710
Huh?

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.760
Don't you find it delightful?

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:49.470
You've already concluded
that you cannot beat him.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:51.970
Looking at it that way...

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.890
...I guess it's all nice and clear.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.430
In which case,
you have just one choice.

00:13:56.930 --> 00:13:57.690
Right.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.190
Just one choice.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.150
Which is...

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:04.610
The wander bug!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:10.740
Hey, mister. I like you.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.080
Would you consider
letting me stay here?

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.490
Only if you win!

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.510
Then it's decided.

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.250
The weaker one will win the fight!

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.210
That's the spirit!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.050
Hoy! Ming!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.170
We're going sailing!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.940
Hey, Domon!

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.780
Where've you been?

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:49.240
Hey, you're pretty confident!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:51.700
Mr. Domon!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:55.620
We're all looking forward to
your big match today!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.120
Yes, to see how you do
in your new Gundam!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.220
I've been waiting.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:15.140
Now, let's see you win
all of your matches...

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.390
...Domon Kasshu!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:28.440
Okay, let's do it! God Gundam!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:06.610
Very well!

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.230
Gundam Fight!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.530
Ready!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.780
Go!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.080
We're sorry for the wait!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.790
The Mobile Trace System
is well synchronized.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.620
He should be fine.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.500
Good luck, Domon!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.720
I commend you on your courage
by shedding your fear like that.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.720
What're you talking about?!

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.590
When it's time for me
to go down...

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:38.430
...I'm taking you with me!

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.640
You're going to sacrifice yourself?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.430
Okay, if that's what you want...

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:45.310
...I'll crush you into dust!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.770
What power!

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.160
Hey, Grandpa.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:16:59.950
Are you sure it was a
good idea...

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.040
...making up that story
about wander bugs?

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.620
Yeah, it was just a little spice.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:08.330
It was a good way to
rid him of all hesitation.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.760
The Vulcan guns have
no effect on him!

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:19.180
Ready to be defeated...

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.600
...little brat from Neo Japan?

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.290
It's just like my dream.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:28.310
Except this time,
I'm a...

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.190
...wander bug!

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:40.700
He did it!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.870
Well, he got Zeus with one hit.

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:48.000
No. The battle has
now just begun.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:53.630
Take this!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.720
Lightning of Judgment!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:10.690
I applaud you!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:14.190
You are the first person
to throw me off of my chariot!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.180
However, your punishment
shall be heavy!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.250
Win every fight, huh?
What a pathetic joke!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.790
Kids like you should
go back to school!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:33.210
Come back in four
or even eight years.

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:36.060
I'll take you on anytime!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:46.720
W-What is Domon doing?!

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:50.810
Oh, well.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.230
It looks like it's game over.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.070
No, he's enduring the attacks...

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.650
...waiting for his moment
to pounce.

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.070
That's right.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.700
Domon Kasshu won't lose
this easily.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.120
And look, the Shuffle Crest
is calling out...

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.660
...to the King of Hearts!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.750
Is that a laugh?

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:16.210
I'm amazed you have the
energy to laugh at your defeat.

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.010
In that case...

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:22.760
...I'll finish you with one blow!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.260
He's flying!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:33.650
Here I come!

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:40.360
Zeus Gundam!
Maximum power!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:42.320
Come, if you dare!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:44.870
I'll keep at it as long as it takes!

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.370
Silence!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.290
Little brat!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.040
Domon!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:58.500
It's time for you to use
your ultimate weapon!

00:19:58.800 --> 00:19:59.880
What do you mean?

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:02.550
Can this new Gundam also
use the Shining Finger?

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:04.090
That's right!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.430
Erupting God Finger!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:09.310
After what you went through
in Guyana, you can do it!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:10.730
That's right.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.750
With the power I received
from my serene mind.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.070
I challenge you!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.290
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.760
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.630
Erupting...

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:48.930
...God Finger!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:05.340
Heat End!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.980
H-how can this be?

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:17.540
It seems I was the one
with all that false bravado.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.680
Wonderful.
That was absolutely wonderful.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.680
You have a keen eye for a winner,
Master East.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:36.770
Domon...

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:37.900
...you pulled it off.

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:44.570
Wonderful!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:47.360
That was a big victory for
the little wander bug!

00:21:48.360 --> 00:21:50.330
And for your jar of spice, too!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.290
Oh, you knew the whole time?

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:59.080
You're a tough one to fool.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:02.500
Domon, what was that all about?

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:03.170
Huh?

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.470
Please tell me.

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.180
Never mind that.

00:22:07.180 --> 00:22:08.680
Let's celebrate!

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:13.550
My very first victory
with God Gundam!

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:28.400
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:30.910
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.410 --> 00:22:36.200
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.200 --> 00:22:38.750
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:43.880
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:47.550
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:54.260
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:01.810
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:06.360
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:09.950
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:17.410
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:26.250
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:36.850
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:38.430
Domon's next match...

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:40.770
...is with Cobra Gundam,
representing Neo India.

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:44.650
It coils around and tightens,
squeezing its opponent.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:47.610
Not only that, when a Gundam
fan gets into mischief...

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:50.450
...Domon finds himself
in great danger.

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:52.950
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.200
Hang On, Domon!

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:56.490
Triumph of the Restored Faith

00:23:54.450 --> 00:24:00.930
Triumph of the Restored Faith

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:58.790
Ready! Go!
